---
import Button from '@/components/shared/ui/button.astro';
---

<section class="shell hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Web development, SEO &amp; automation · Phoenix, Arizona</p>
  <h1>
    A better website.
    <br />
    A clearer path
    <br />
    <span>from inquiry to client.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="max-w-2xl text-lead">
    ZiaFlow helps Arizona service businesses improve their websites, search visibility, and lead follow-up. We connect
    forms, phone intake, and CRM workflows so your team knows who needs a response and what happens next.
  </p>
  <img
    class="mt-10 aspect-[16/7] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover"
    src="/images/phoenix-skyline.jpg"
    alt="Phoenix skyline at sunset"
    width="1600"
    height="700"
    fetchpriority="high"
  />
  <div class="actions">
    <Button label="Discuss your project" href="/contact" />
    <Button label="Explore our services" href="#services" variant="outline" />
  </div>
  <p>Start with the part that needs attention: getting found, turning visits into inquiries, or following up.</p>
</section>
